{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 11, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun a most wondrous quest I shall now spin.\n\n**Day First Tokyo's Grand Entrance**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive\nAt Narita's gate where new adventures thrive.\nTo Shinjuku's heights we swiftly make our way\nA city of lights where dreams hold sway.\nA Sumptuous inn awaits thy weary head\nThen dinner's feast where flavors are spread.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Ancient Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall then proceed\nSenso-ji's grace a spiritual deed.\nThrough Nakamise-dori's stalls we'll stroll\nFor trinkets and treats to enrich the soul.\nThen Ueno Park a haven green and wide\nWhere art and nature lovingly reside.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Mountain Majesty**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's peaks we go\nWhere Mount Fuji's visage doth brightly glow.\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi serene and calm\nSurrounded by beauty a soothing balm.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum a sight to behold\nSculptures and vistas stories untold.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Imperial Charm**\n\nBy bullet train swift we shall now depart\nTo Kyoto's embrace a work of art.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vibrant hue\nA thousand vermillion a wondrous view.\nGion's district where geishas softly glide\nA glimpse of old Japan with graceful pride.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Golden Temple**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a golden dream\nReflecting in waters a shimmering gleam.\nRyoan-ji's garden a meditative space\nZen's quiet wisdom a tranquil grace.\nNijo Castle's halls where shoguns did reign\nA testament to power and ancient gain.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer and Temples**\n\nTo Nara we venture a city of grace\nWhere friendly deer roam at a leisurely pace.\nTodai-ji Temple holds a giant Buddha's form\nA sacred presence weathering every storm.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns a dazzling sight\nIlluminating pathways with gentle light.\n\n**Day Seventh Osaka's Culinary Delights**\n\nTo Osaka's kitchens our appetites we turn\nFor takoyaki okonomiyaki lessons we learn.\nDotonbori's lights a vibrant display\nA feast for the senses come what may.\nOsaka Castle stands proud and tall\nA historical landmark embracing all.\n\n**Day Eighth Farewell Japan**\n\nWith heavy hearts we bid this land adieu\nMemories cherished forever true.\nFrom bustling cities to temples serene\nJapan's magic within us will convene.\nThy journey concludes thy spirit takes flight\nUntil we meet again bathed in golden light.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.009764053858816624}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5308548808097839}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.8752150535583496}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0012949660886079073}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.06434878706932068}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.23844827711582184}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.04435422271490097}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -3.2186455882765586e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.04064467176795006}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.0897618979215622}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.04371974617242813}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.2366156429052353}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.18054966628551483}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.007259538397192955}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.7119142413139343}, {"token": "▁spin", "logprob": -2.039818286895752}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0523577556014061}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.004279978107661009}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -9.536697689327411e-06}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.0018963703187182546}, {"token": "▁First", "logprob": -1.461068868637085}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", "logprob": -0.580043375492096}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.016420701518654823}, {"token": "s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁Grand", "logprob": -0.09149538725614548}, {"token": "▁Entrance", "logprob": -0.619